tatement></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><fig position="float" id="uro1"><label>Figure </label><graphic xlink:href="173cor1"></graphic></fig></p><p><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="169" page="515" id="N0x3338db0N0x3855930" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="15866889" ext-link-type="pubmed">Vol. 169, No. 3, May 9, 2005. Pages 515&#x02013;526.</related-article></p><p>In the preparation of Figure 6 E, scans for Figure 3 (left panel) that were from the same original film were accidentally used. Original films of these figures have been submitted to JCB and the correct Figure 6 E is provided here. This does not in any way affect the conclusions of the paper. We do apologize for the error.</p></body></article>